WEBVTT

00:20:29.015 --> 00:20:30.725
and take care of yourself.

00:20:30.767 --> 00:20:32.477
And I am really fortunate.

00:20:32.519 --> 00:20:35.355
I think I have a great
support network around me

00:20:35.397 --> 00:20:36.439
and I do ...

00:20:37.899 --> 00:20:40.193
My husband and I have a deal,

00:20:40.193 --> 00:20:43.071
where on Sundays,
I disappear for a couple of hours.

00:20:43.113 --> 00:20:44.489
I just disappear

00:20:44.489 --> 00:20:47.575
and I walk around the city
and I listen to my music

00:20:47.617 --> 00:20:50.120
and do whatever I need to do,

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:51.621
and that's really important.

00:20:51.621 --> 00:20:53.498
SM: So you talked about how hybrid work

00:20:53.498 --> 00:20:55.750
is going to look
very different in the future

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.294
than how we describe it today.

00:20:57.294 --> 00:21:02.549
It's basically in office a couple of days,
work from home a couple of other days.